  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 39 ÷ 3 – 11+ 57 × 29 = 171.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) – and × **\n\nGiven: 39 ÷ 3 – 11 + 57 × 29 = 171\n\nAfter interchanging the sign we get;\n\n⇒** __39 ÷ 3 × 11 __+ 57 – 29 = 171**\n\n**⇒ __143 + 57__ - 29 = 171**\n\n**⇒ __200 - 29__ = 171**\n\n**⇒ 171 = 171**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) – and + \n\nGiven: 39 ÷ 3 – 11 + 57 × 29 = 171\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**39 ÷ 3**__ + 11 - 57 × 29 = 171\n\n⇒ 13 + 11 - __**57 × 29**__ = 171\n\n⇒ __**13 + 11**__ - 1653 = 171\n\n⇒ __**24 - 1653**__ = 171\n\n⇒ -1629 ≠ 171\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ÷ and +\n\nGiven: 39 ÷ 3 – 11 + 57 × 29 = 171\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 39 + 3 – __**11 ÷ 57 × 29**__ = 171\n\n⇒ __**39 + 3**__ – 5.596 = 171\n\n⇒ __**42 – 5.596**__ = 171\n\n⇒ 47.596 ≠ 171\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) ÷ and -\n\nGiven: 39 ÷ 3 – 11 + 57 × 29 = 171\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 39 - __**3 ÷ 11**__ + 57 × 29 = 171\n\n⇒ 39 - 0.272 + __**57 × 29**__ = 171\n\n⇒ __**39 - 0.272 + 1653**__ = 171\n\n⇒ 1691.728 ≠ 171\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
